{"method":"item/started","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"exec-bbb8d003-14cc-4e9f-b36b-9d17ba970977","pluginId":null,"scriptPath":null,"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' .llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/supervisor.md\nsed -n '1,220p' .llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/plan.md\ngh pr view 1965 --json number,title,isDraft,headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,labels,milestone,commits --jq '{number,title,isDraft,headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,labels:[.labels[].name],milestone:.milestone.title,commits:[.commits[].oid]}'\ngh pr view 1965 --comments --json comments --jq '.comments[] | {author:.author.login,body:.body,url:.url}'\"","cwd":"/home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-aspire-leaf-1881","processId":"79277","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"inProgress","commandActions":[{"type":"unknown","command":"sed -n '1,240p' .llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/supervisor.md\nsed -n '1,220p' .llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/plan.md\ngh pr view 1965 --json number,title,isDraft,headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,labels,milestone,commits --jq '{number,title,isDraft,headRefOid,baseRefOid,body,labels:[.labels[].name],milestone:.milestone.title,commits:[.commits[].oid]}'\ngh pr view 1965 --comments --json comments --jq '.comments[] | {author:.author.login,body:.body,url:.url}'"}],"aggregatedOutput":null,"exitCode":null,"durationMs":null},"threadId":"01a06491-c069-7610-999b-e4f3efa4096f","turnId":"01a06491-c0b5-7811-a584-1b84e145973e","startedAtMs":1788395662146},"emittedAtMs":1788395662147}
{"method":"item/commandExecution/outputDelta","params":{"threadId":"01a06491-c069-7610-999b-e4f3efa4096f","turnId":"01a06491-c0b5-7811-a584-1b84e145973e","itemId":"exec-bbb8d003-14cc-4e9f-b36b-9d17ba970977","delta":"{\"baseRefOid\":\"79adb103be568260e51b0eb3ba9fae281a5fe1f0\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nAdds a clean-runner E2E suite that parses and executes the root README Quickstart in printed order against an exact published JSR CLI. The suite permits only the documented version and service-port substitutions, records every command as its own no-retry gate, and retains the existing ownership-proving cleanup tail.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n- Archetype / area: CLI/tooling E2E gate + root Quickstart documentation\\n- Closes #1881\\n- Part of #863\\n- Parent epic: #1712\\n\\n## Slices\\n\\n- [x] S0 Lock current research, design, and gate plan — `75c41ee15`\\n- [ ] S1 Add README markers, executable readiness, pure parser, and drift tests\\n- [ ] S2 Register and prove the no-retry `readme.quickstart` suite\\n- [ ] S3 Wire the hosted production runner (isolated workflow commit)\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Scoped check — PASS (223 files, no diagnostics)\\n- CLI E2E tests — PASS (302 passed, 0 failed)\\n- Scoped format — PASS (223 files, no findings)\\n- Scoped lint — baseline tooling refusal: zero findings; seven unchanged standalone desktop fixture files cannot resolve their existing root `catalog:` dependency\\n- Runtime suites — NOT RUN locally; no runtime lease, hosted next-canary proof only\\n\\n## Harness\\n\\n- Run dir: `.llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/`\\n- Phase: impl — see per-slice comments and committed artifacts.\\n- PLAN-EVAL: N/A; the coordinator supplied the exact baseline, contract, substitutions, gates, runtime boundary, and commit ordering.\\n- Do not merge until the mandatory separate-session IMPL-EVAL and hosted canary evidence are complete.\\n\\n## Drift / Debt\\n\\n- Minor: the parent research artifact named in the brief is absent at the pinned baseline; Aspire 13.5.3 wait syntax was re-verified directly.\\n- Significant baseline tooling drift: the exact lint wrapper refuses the pre-existing standalone desktop fixture configuration; no lint findings are reported.\\n- No new or deepened architecture debt.\\n\\n## Definition of Done\\n\\n- [ ] Root README marker block and executable readiness command are parser- and drift-tested.\\n- [ ] `readme.quickstart` exposes one no-retry receipt gate per printed command and preserves foreign-resource cleanup doctrine.\\n- [ ] Hosted `readme.quickstart` transcript at a canary tag is attached.\\n- [ ] Separate-session IMPL-EVAL PASS is recorded.\",\"commits\":[\"75c41ee15f940bea198cb6b29064b3c95f856bf4\",\"7729b9aa06745b53e64958c6cc4765489aec71e7\"],\"headRefOid\":\"7729b9aa06745b53e64958c6cc4765489aec71e7\",\"isDraft\":true,\"labels\":[\"area:cli\",\"status:impl\",\"area:aspire\",\"gate:e2e\",\"type:test\",\"priority:p1\",\"orchestrator:aspire\"],\"milestone\":\"0.0.7\",\"number\":1965,\"title\":\"test(e2e): walk the root README quickstart verbatim on the clean prod runner (#863 gate 3)\"}\n"},"emittedAtMs":1788395662435}
