{"method":"item/started","params":{"item":{"type":"fileChange","id":"exec-6332e3b9-5a04-4489-810c-d4863d88f2f2","changes":[{"path":"/home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-aspire-leaf-1881/.llm/tmp/leaf-1881-pr-body.md","kind":{"type":"delete"},"diff":"## Summary\n\nAdds a clean-runner E2E suite that parses and executes the root README Quickstart in printed order against an exact published JSR CLI. The suite permits only the documented version and service-port substitutions, records every command as its own no-retry gate, and retains the existing ownership-proving cleanup tail.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Archetype / area: CLI/tooling E2E gate + root Quickstart documentation\n- Closes #1881\n- Part of #863\n- Parent epic: #1712\n\n## Slices\n\n- [x] S0 Lock current research, design, and gate plan — `75c41ee15`\n- [x] S1 Add README markers, executable readiness, pure parser, and drift tests — `7729b9aa0`\n- [x] S2 Register and prove the no-retry `readme.quickstart` suite — `7729b9aa0`\n- [ ] S3 Wire the hosted production runner — local isolated commit `6adc9b412`, push requires supervisor's workflow-scoped credential\n\n## Validation\n\n- Scoped check — PASS (229 files, no diagnostics)\n- CLI E2E tests — PASS (314 passed, 0 failed)\n- Scoped format — PASS (229 files, no findings)\n- Suite/gate listings, carrier freshness, quality gate, and workflow YAML parse — PASS\n- Scoped lint — baseline tooling refusal: zero findings; seven unchanged standalone desktop fixture files cannot resolve their existing root `catalog:` dependency\n- Runtime suites — NOT RUN locally; no runtime lease, hosted next-canary proof only\n\n## Harness\n\n- Run dir: `.llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/`\n- Phase: evaluated — see per-slice comments and committed artifacts.\n- PLAN-EVAL: N/A; the coordinator supplied the exact baseline, contract, substitutions, gates, runtime boundary, and commit ordering.\n- Separate-session IMPL-EVAL: PASS — Claude Fable 5.1 medium session `a3e6affc-fea3-4f66-8754-976873d16775`; the artifact is in local S3 commit `6adc9b412` pending workflow-scoped push.\n- Do not merge until the hosted canary evidence completes the issue/PR close-gate.\n\n## Drift / Debt\n\n- Minor: the parent research artifact named in the brief is absent at the pinned baseline; Aspire 13.5.3 wait syntax was re-verified directly.\n- Significant baseline tooling drift: the exact lint wrapper refuses the pre-existing standalone desktop fixture configuration; no lint findings are reported.\n- README fidelity deliberately exposes fresh-publication dependency-age and non-TTY behavior to the hosted verdict.\n- No new or deepened architecture debt.\n\n## Definition of Done\n\n- [x] Root README marker block and executable readiness command are parser- and drift-tested.\n- [x] `readme.quickstart` exposes one no-retry receipt gate per printed command and preserves foreign-resource cleanup doctrine.\n- [ ] Hosted `readme.quickstart` transcript at a canary tag is attached.\n- [x] Separate-session IMPL-EVAL PASS is recorded.\n"},{"path":"/home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-aspire-leaf-1881/.llm/tmp/leaf-1881-s3-comment.md","kind":{"type":"delete"},"diff":"[PHASE: IMPL]\n\nS3 is prepared as the isolated last local commit:\n\n- `6adc9b412` — `ci(e2e): run root README quickstart on clean runner`\n- workflow YAML parse: PASS\n- repeated pre-push check: PASS (229 files)\n- repeated tests: PASS (314/314)\n- repeated format: PASS (229/229)\n- repeated suites + `gates readme.quickstart`: PASS\n- exact lint wrapper: unchanged baseline coverage refusal, exit 2, zero findings\n- independent S3 A1 review: PASS, Claude Fable 5.1 low session `33acaeee-4ed1-4cca-a6c6-8fb1dd382c4c`\n- formal separate-session IMPL-EVAL: PASS, Claude Fable 5.1 medium session `a3e6affc-fea3-4f66-8754-976873d16775`\n\nThe workflow commit push was attempted exactly once and rejected because the current credential lacks workflow scope. Per the coordinator instruction, no alternate credential/retry was attempted.\n\nExact result (exit 1):\n\n```text\nTo https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript.git\n ! [remote rejected]     test/aspire-1881-readme-quickstart -> test/aspire-1881-readme-quickstart (refusing to allow a Personal Access Token to create or update workflow `.github/workflows/e2e-cli-prod.yml` without `workflow` scope)\nerror: failed to push some refs to 'https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript.git'\n```\n\nRemote PR head remains `7729b9aa06745b53e64958c6cc4765489aec71e7`. Supervisor handoff: push local commit `6adc9b412` with the workflow-scoped credential. The PR remains draft / `status:impl`; hosted canary transcript and merge close-gate remain pending.\n"}],"status":"inProgress"},"threadId":"01a06491-c069-7610-999b-e4f3efa4096f","turnId":"01a06491-c0b5-7811-a584-1b84e145973e","startedAtMs":1788396242451},"emittedAtMs":1788396242451}
