{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_06489e0aa78d67c8016a98c2e31ffc87d29444bba231519cb8","text":"Implemented and reviewed the `readme.quickstart` gate. The gate code is pushed to PR [#1965](https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript/pull/1965); the isolated workflow commit is complete locally but could not be pushed because the current PAT lacks `workflow` scope.\n\nKey state:\n\n- PR: [#1965](https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript/pull/1965)\n- Remote PR head: `7729b9aa06745b53e64958c6cc4765489aec71e7`\n- Local head awaiting supervisor push: `6adc9b412f898f7d542a219f0d6ad18f70b86a3c`\n- Branch is exactly one commit ahead of remote.\n- Worktree is clean.\n- PR remains draft with `status:impl`, milestone `0.0.7`, and the requested labels.\n- `Closes #1881` and `Part of #863` remain in the PR body.\n- Hosted canary transcript remains unticked; the PR is not ready to merge.\n\nDelivered:\n\n- Marker-bounded root README parser and drift test.\n- Executable readiness line:\n  `aspire wait postgres --status healthy --timeout 60`\n- Eleven ordered, no-retry command gates with line-aware bounded receipts.\n- Only `<version>` and receipt-backed `<port>` substitutions.\n- Isolated smoke-root execution and context-derived AppHost evidence.\n- Unchanged `createCleanupGates()` ownership/foreign-resource behavior.\n- Suite registry, stable CLI constants, tests, and E2E documentation.\n- Hosted workflow step, failure-summary integration, and artifact collection in isolated commit `6adc9b412`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Scoped check: PASS, 229 files.\n- CLI E2E tests: PASS, 314/314.\n- Scoped format: PASS, 229/229.\n- Suite and `readme.quickstart` gate listings: PASS.\n- Carrier freshness and `quality:gate`: PASS.\n- Workflow YAML parse: PASS.\n- Scoped lint: exit 2 from the documented pre-existing seven-file desktop fixture coverage refusal; zero lint findings.\n- Runtime suites were not run locally, as required.\n\nIndependent reviews:\n\n- S1/S2 A1 review: PASS after fixes, Fable session `d1b8dd03-8be6-477f-a80e-8a342077b81f`.\n- S3 A1 review: PASS, Fable session `33acaeee-4ed1-4cca-a6c6-8fb1dd382c4c`.\n- Formal separate-session IMPL-EVAL: PASS, Fable medium session `a3e6affc-fea3-4f66-8754-976873d16775`.\n- Evaluation: [evaluate.md](/home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-aspire-leaf-1881/.llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/evaluate.md)\n- Worklog: [worklog.md](/home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-aspire-leaf-1881/.llm/runs/research-aspire-13.5-adoption--0.0.7/slices/leaf-1881/worklog.md)\n\nThe implementation push succeeded:\n\n```text\nTo https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript.git\n   75c41ee15..7729b9aa0  test/aspire-1881-readme-quickstart -> test/aspire-1881-readme-quickstart\n```\n\nThe isolated workflow push was attempted once and failed with exit code 1. Per instruction, I did not retry or use another credential:\n\n```text\nTo https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript.git\n ! [remote rejected]     test/aspire-1881-readme-quickstart -> test/aspire-1881-readme-quickstart (refusing to allow a Personal Access Token to create or update workflow `.github/workflows/e2e-cli-prod.yml` without `workflow` scope)\nerror: failed to push some refs to 'https://github.com/rickylabs/netscript.git'\n```\n\nSupervisor handoff: push existing local commit `6adc9b412f898f7d542a219f0d6ad18f70b86a3c` with the workflow-scoped credential. No rebase, amendment, regeneration, or additional implementation is required.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null},"threadId":"01a06491-c069-7610-999b-e4f3efa4096f","turnId":"01a06491-c0b5-7811-a584-1b84e145973e","completedAtMs":1788396276209},"emittedAtMs":1788396276213}
